exports[`render stars rows that moved and leads the markdown with them 1`] = `
"Each cell shows its two-sided permutation p-value against base, and * marks p < 0.1. all/<arm> pools every case's runs. † marks a cell with too few runs on one side for any star, which takes at least 4 against 4 at 0.1. ! marks a case whose errored runs, such as a session limit, were left out of the pool.

| measure | row | base | next |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Case score | c/with | 1.00 | 0.00 (p=0.001)* |
| Reply words | c/with | 3 | 6 (p=0.001)* |
| Turns per run | c/with | 2.0 | 5.0 (p=0.001)* |
| Seconds per run | c/with | 10.0 | 30.0 (p=0.001)* |
| Output tokens per run | c/with | 500 | 900 (p=0.001)* |
| Cost per run (USD) | c/with | 0.100 | 0.300 (p=0.001)* |
| Grader pass rate | c/with · fact | 1.00 | 0.00 (p=0.001)* |
| Grader pass rate | c/with · fired (indicator) | 1.00 | 0.00 (p=0.001)* |

